   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a name=\"m_-4197331250041042878__MailEndCompose\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Chris,<u></u><u></u></span></a></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">No, the order of blocks does not matter: it is a correlation/covariance based test not a regression. However, it looks\r\n like you have also uncovered a small bug, as this should run both ways. So for your immediate problem just run the order the other way; we’ll look into the bug.<u></u><u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Dean<u></u><u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Dr. Dean C. Adams<u></u><u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Professor<u></u><u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Department of Ecology, Evolution, and Organismal Biology<u></u><u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">       Department of Statistics<u></u><u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Iowa State University<u></u><u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span></span><a href=\"http://www.public.iastate.edu/~dcadams/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.public.iastate.edu/~dcadams/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485866425000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0j7KeFiVYuWlb6DnJum-Ad\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:purple\">www.public.iastate.edu/~dcadams/</span></span><span></span></a><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u><u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">phone: <a href=\"tel:(515)%20294-3834\" value=\"+15152943834\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">515-294-3834</a><u></u><u></u></span></span></p></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\"><div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<span></span>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">From:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">cjl...@gmail.com</a> [mailto:<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">cjl...@gmail.com</a>]\r\n<b>On Behalf Of </b>Chris Law<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Wednesday, January 24, 2018 5:47 PM<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">geomorph-...@googlegroups.com</a><br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> [geomorph-r-package] 2-block PLS with single variable<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">Hi all,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">I have a somewhat silly question. When running a 2-block PLS between a landmark dataset (shape3D) and a single variable (BF), does the order of the blocks matter? <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">I ask because the function runs smoothly with <i>phylo.integration(<b>BF, shape3D</b>, tree_prune, iter=999)</i><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">but running<i> phylo.integration(<b>shape3D, BF</b> , tree_prune, iter=999)\r\n</i>leds to this error: Error in y %*% V : non-conformable arguments</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">I am trying to examine how cranial shape is associated with bite force (BF), essentially hoping to find a linear combination of shape variables that predicts BF. So I&#39;m hoping to run a model that\r\n resembles BF ~ shape3D.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">I greatly appreciate your help.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">Best,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\">Chris<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Chris Law<u></u><u></u></b></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>​</b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\"> <u></u><u></u></span></b></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt\">|</span><b><u></u><u></u></b></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\"> </span>​</b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></b></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt\">Graduate Student</span><b><u></u><u></u></b></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\"> <u></u><u></u></span></b></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt\">|</span><b><u></u><u></u></b></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\"> </span>​</b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></b></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt\">University of California, Santa Cruz</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt\">​</span><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\"> <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt\">Coastal Biology Building<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt\">​</span><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">130 McAllister Way <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Santa Cruz, CA 95060<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">cj...@ucsc.edu</span></a> <span style=\"font-size:9.5pt\">| </span><a href=\"http://research.pbsci.ucsc.edu/eeb/cjlaw/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://research.pbsci.ucsc.edu/eeb/cjlaw/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485866425000&amp;usg=AOvVaw10cYfQGVxh2ulC7vlkWmZs\"><span s